WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.668 --> 00:00:15.535
Brad: did the mites give Chuck and Dave to those ants?

2
00:00:15.555 --> 00:00:19.237
Danny: It looked like the ants paid for the bullies.

3
00:00:19.257 --> 00:00:21.678
Brad: So what are we going to do now?

4
00:00:21.698 --> 00:00:24.360
Danny: I guess we have to follow the ants.

5
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:31.683
Danny: They’re coming back.

6
00:00:32.908 --> 00:00:34.089
Brad: Quick, hide!

7
00:00:34.109 --> 00:00:36.991
Danny: We have to find a way out of here.

8
00:00:37.011 --> 00:00:39.893
Brad: I think that’s going to be difficult.

9
00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:43.455
Danny: I’ll check if the coast is clear.

10
00:00:43.475 --> 00:00:47.858
Brad: Can you see anything?

11
00:00:47.878 --> 00:00:50.720
Danny: There’s something happening by the gate.

12
00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:51.821
Brad: What?

13
00:00:51.841 --> 00:00:55.803
Danny: What are they doing?

14
00:00:55.823 --> 00:00:58.605
Brad: They are opening the gate.

15
00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:02.508
Danny: I think someone is coming in.

16
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.062
Brad: Maybe the ants are bringing the bullies back.

17
00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:11.747
Brad: Look, all the mites are gathering at the gate.

18
00:01:11.767 --> 00:01:14.309
Danny: They look excited about something.

19
00:01:18.773 --> 00:01:20.795
I can’t see any mites anywhere else.

20
00:01:20.815 --> 00:01:24.278
Brad: Maybe now is a good time to try to escape.

21
00:01:24.298 --> 00:01:28.321
Danny: No.

22
00:01:28.701 --> 00:01:29.462
Something is up.

23
00:01:30.283 --> 00:01:31.444
It’s something important.

24
00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:34.481
Brad: How do you know that?

25
00:01:34.501 --> 00:01:36.863
Danny: It’s just a feeling.

26
00:01:36.883 --> 00:01:40.526
Brad: My feeling is that we should make a run for it!

27
00:01:40.546 --> 00:01:46.251
Brad: They’re happy about something.

28
00:01:46.271 --> 00:01:49.994
Danny: What could possibly make a mite happy?

29
00:01:54.718 --> 00:01:55.819
Oh my gosh!

30
00:01:55.839 --> 00:01:58.981
Danny: I I don’t understand!

31
00:01:59.001 --> 00:02:03.144
Brad: It’s Hopian!

32
00:02:03.184 --> 00:02:03.525
Danny: And Tina!

33
00:02:03.545 --> 00:02:06.207
Brad: How did Tina find Hopian?

34
00:02:06.227 --> 00:02:09.150
Danny: And how did they both get here?

35
00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:13.094
Bello: What are we going to do, Tina?

36
00:02:13.114 --> 00:02:15.436
Tina: I’m thinking, Bello.

37
00:02:16.297 --> 00:02:17.758
We have to escape somehow.

38
00:02:17.778 --> 00:02:20.741
Bello: But there are so many of them.

39
00:02:22.122 --> 00:02:24.684
Tina: My guess is that they aren’t as smart as us.

40
00:02:26.867 --> 00:02:28.168
This must be their fort.

41
00:02:30.764 --> 00:02:32.745
Bello: Those walls are very high.

42
00:02:32.765 --> 00:02:35.505
Tina: Wait!

43
00:02:35.886 --> 00:02:36.686
Look up there!

44
00:02:36.706 --> 00:02:39.867
Bello: That’s Brad and Danny!

45
00:02:40.507 --> 00:02:42.347
They look just like I remember.

46
00:02:42.367 --> 00:02:44.468
Tina: What are they doing here?

47
00:02:44.488 --> 00:02:47.489
Tina: I thought they shrunk the bullies, not themselves.

48
00:02:47.889 --> 00:02:50.110
Bello: It looks like they are prisoners too.

49
00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:54.651
Tina: I’ve got an idea.

50
00:02:55.991 --> 00:02:57.552
Look up there in the tower!

51
00:02:58.316 --> 00:03:00.320
Tina: I think they’re trying to escape!

52
00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:03.145
Danny: Why is she doing that?

53
00:03:03.165 --> 00:03:05.408
Brad: I don’t know, but look out!

54
00:03:06.009 --> 00:03:07.692
The mites are all coming this way.

55
00:03:07.712 --> 00:03:09.916
Danny: That Tina!

56
00:03:10.197 --> 00:03:11.679
She’s nothing but trouble!
